      "title": "风暴鲍里斯席卷欧洲，造成至少6人死亡、数千人撤离家园",
      "publisher": "lbc",
      "identified_publisher": "LBC",
      "source_domain": "lbc.co.uk",
      "url": "https://www.lbc.co.uk/news/storm-boris-europe-six-dead-thousands-evacuated/",
      "published_at": "2024-09-15T13:35:03+00:00",
      "updated_at": null,
      "language": "zh",
